Subject: [PATCH] refactor(docs): rename plan-stage design.md -> plan.md across
 the repo [KA1]
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

"design.md" is reserved for real design (frontend/theme/methodology); the PLANNING
artifact is the plan, so it is now plan.md — for clean, consistent tracking.

- git mv 75 historical docs/work/<slug>/design.md -> plan.md (history preserved).
- Update references (skills, AGENTS.md, .claude/.cursorrules/.github templates, docs)
  with targeted patterns that PROTECT real-design refs (kernel-skill-surface-design.md,
  PROJECT_DESIGN.md's frontend/theme refs, beads-supabase-...-memory-design.md, superpowers).
- Convention: lib/commands/plan.js now WRITES plan.md. Detection reads BOTH (new plan.md
  + legacy design.md): orientation.js both-list restored, status.js stripMarkdownSuffixes
  handles -plan and -design, so historical folders still resolve.
- Fixed markdown-link breakage from the rename in work-folder READMEs.
- docs-link-baseline: restored + surgically updated the renamed work-folder paths
  (historical docs/plans/*-design.md known-broken entries left intact).
- .codex mirror regenerated (inSync). Tests updated (contract/plan/status): 217 pass.

Historical docs/plans/*-design.md breadcrumbs (pre-existing, archival, already broken)
left as-is. Refs kernel epic b6bdf122, KA1 (fa5805e0).

